WEBVTT

00:08:58.621 --> 00:09:02.591
This poster is wirelessly
connected to my cell phone,

00:09:02.615 --> 00:09:05.467
and when you touch it,
it connects to the app.

00:09:05.491 --> 00:09:12.157
(Drums)

00:09:13.778 --> 00:09:15.598
And it has really good response time.

00:09:15.622 --> 00:09:19.828
It's using Bluetooth 4, so
it's pretty instantaneous.

00:09:20.322 --> 00:09:22.880
Okay. Thanks.

00:09:22.904 --> 00:09:26.620
(Applause)

00:09:27.168 --> 00:09:28.930
And there's a couple of other things.

00:09:28.954 --> 00:09:31.462
So this one is like a sound board,